plugin/usdNoodles/ (localized usdview Noodles editor)
-----------------------------------------------------

Ported from usdRig commit 8dafce7d6d6299e6f79f9c4fb22c17145d96359e,
based on OpenUSD PR #4156. The Python,
binding, and editor code retains Meta/OpenUSD notices under the Tomorrow
Open Source Technology License 1.0; see plugin/usdNoodles/LICENSE.txt.

Native noodles and copied GLSL code retains Meta's MIT license; see
plugin/usdNoodles/NOODLES_LICENSE.txt. Its upstream noodles dependency is
pinned to commit ff5d473f10e8c37ceaf0da11ea7cb80805bc8314.

Poppins font atlases are under SIL Open Font License 1.1. Their license and
other dependency notices are in plugin/usdNoodles/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.
The local port removes rig-only TouchPose references and adapts build and
installation paths for usdGen without changing upstream notices.

